{"server":"tw","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_07_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_07","title":"陰影顯現","storyCode":"BB-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"1aeb9ce389abb4983d7b791892efa6219d80682ec63327a64bee48f886018227","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"1094年初\n卡茲戴爾地區，卡茲戴爾移動城市"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等等，將軍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你太浮躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是！那位公爵的使者幾乎是打算把唾沫吐在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得到想要的了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確拿到了部分工業區的使用權和邊境通行權……但一定要以那樣屈辱的方式嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的公爵對您呼來喝去，把薩卡茲當作順從的野獸，那些從內戰中抬起頭來的戰士們等待的並不是今天，將軍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是正如我們所願？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們想要維多利亞從一開始就把薩卡茲當作最大的敵人，然後團結一致來對付我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是您的……我知道示敵以弱的必要性，可這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們之中的很多人，認為這毫不榮耀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我許諾他們的，是榮耀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人眼裡的薩卡茲，有榮耀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，你最近太急躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……尊嚴很重要，曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會為戰士們打抱不平，也會有人因此而尊敬你。若是平常，也許我會誇讚你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，我們在做什麼？在準備竊取一個國家的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在瓦解這片大地上最強大的帝國。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的隔閡令他們脆弱不堪，而薩卡茲正飢腸轆轆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們需要的本就不是“榮耀”“尊敬”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的軍隊準備得如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整裝待發。先行的同胞會在倫蒂尼姆接應我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快就是卡文迪許公爵要求我們抵達的最後期限，我們隨時可以出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們啟程，去毀滅維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g7_councilchamber"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一直在值守？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍事委員會衛士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先退下吧，我想一個人待一下子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍事委員會衛士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，長官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"待守衛離去，曼弗雷德取出放在一旁的酒杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來一杯嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前從不喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在也不喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是將軍命令我學習維多利亞人的“禮儀”，為接下來的任務做準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在才知道，原來那些貴族吃一頓飯需要搭配好幾種酒，每種酒還要搭配不同的杯子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得嗎？小時候將軍領著我們去古戰場練劍……晚上天氣冷，將軍煮了湯才發現我們沒有盛湯的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過戰場四處都散落著炮彈殼，你就用它們削了四隻杯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、我、將軍還有殿下，就端著彈殼做的杯子，圍坐在篝火前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，很安靜的一夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就和現在一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"殘冬冰涼的月光落進窗戶，曼弗雷德的手按上劍柄，也是一樣的冰涼。\n空氣裡靜極了，兩人都可以聽到彼此的心跳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們明天就會去倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你想見將軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該沒見到，不然也不會到我這來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我放棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發現自己遠遠看到他的第一眼，腦海冒出的念頭是，我現在應該動手殺了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你應該慶幸自己保住了一絲理性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你現在來找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你的劍術水準提升很多，讓我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來都打不過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒倒下，就別求饒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有次我們在特蕾西婭殿下的書房裡面打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一整面牆的書都落了下來，將軍收走了我們的武器，限我們在半個小時內將書房恢復原樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道當時你是故意的，你想引起兩位殿下的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸身形一晃，眨眼間匿入陰影中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"再一眨眼，曼弗雷德便感受到自己頸側劃過一絲涼意。\n他沒有拔出劍來抵抗，甚至沒有來得及生出抵抗的念頭。\n是太疲憊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我在這裡劃開你的脖子，至少可以讓你不用死在倫蒂尼姆，我會把你的屍體扔進熔爐裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也可以讓很多人不用死在異國他鄉的戰場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你下定決心的話，應該立刻殺了我，這是你最後的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍說你缺少自己的信念，我覺得不盡然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"性命被別人威脅的時候，不該有這麼多話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到最近我才明白，我並不比你堅定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都是被看不見的浪潮推到了這一步……可是從戰爭開始的那天起，我們就都沒有回頭路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就……盡量活下去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次，我不會收手的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默的刺客收起了袖刃，緩緩退回陰影中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願這是我們的最後一次見面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾地區，巴別塔羅德島本艦"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一陣寒風將殘冬厚實的雲層吹散，陽光從裂隙間穿過，鋪在艦橋上。\n台階下，阿斯卡綸站在護欄旁一動不動。\n她緊閉雙目，享受陽光帶來的片刻暖意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"台階上，一陣織物摩擦地面的窸窣聲傳來。\n過路者的影子晃過刺客的面龐，遮住了從天空灑下的陽光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我打擾到你休息了嗎，阿斯卡綸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為把鞋子脫掉走路，就不會有什麼聲音了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，無論何時，都不會打擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地上很冷，您得趕快把鞋穿好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不想和我說說嗎，阿斯卡綸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下指的是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回卡茲戴爾的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這是我擅自做的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想您是不同意的，我不知道要怎麼主動向殿下您開口……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢，阿斯卡綸？既然是你的決定，我也會相信你的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你見到他們了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他和曼弗雷德都很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信。他們都是很強大的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也該做好準備，奪回卡茲戴爾的作戰不會太遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何你的眉頭反而鎖得更緊了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們最近的作戰計劃很激進，在各個戰場都取得了不少戰果……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我總是會感到一種不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴別塔變化很多，尤其是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士變了很多，行事作風更加高效，更加冷靜，就像……一台不會有差錯的機器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一位指揮官應當具備的品質，為什麼反而讓你擔憂呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起現在這位優秀的指揮官……我更信任那個會從馱獸背上狼狽滾下來的傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，現在真的是進攻卡茲戴爾的好時機嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的直覺總是很準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下也憂慮過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你不記得了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年，有多少次，我們遇上了看上去萬萬無法克服的絕境。可最終，我們都一一跨了過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想接下來，也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們始終是在冒險……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸，巴別塔是背負了許多人的希望、信念才走到今天的，我們沒有辦法停在原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與軍事委員會的對抗，我們始終落於下風。眼下，他們的主力部隊大多前往了倫蒂尼姆，這是絕無僅有的機會。我們沒有選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定會在您身旁，保護好您的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將來，你一定要去更遠的地方，去保護更多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，放鬆一下，曬一會太陽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，記得不要總是站著小憩，疲勞時還是該回房間好好睡一覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會記住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陽光重新回到阿斯卡綸的臉上。\n明媚，暖和。可方才在影子移去的那刻，她卻突然感到自胸口泛出一絲異樣。\n當時她尚不能體會，多年後，某個陽光正好的日子裡，她才突然醒悟。\n那是不捨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞，倫蒂尼姆"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"傭兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"傳公爵的口諭，這次攻入倫蒂尼姆，你們做得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"一個小時後在中央城區集結，在那裡接受檢閱，領取你們的賞金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"……喂！聽到命令了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我已收到命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請代我向公爵回覆，我們會按時趕到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……薩卡茲感謝他的慷慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"裝模作樣的魔族佬……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"如果不是硝煙彌漫，今天本該是倫蒂尼姆難得的好天氣。站在高聳的城牆上，這座古老城市的風景可以一覽無遺。\n戰袍染血的將軍一言不發，他的眼神緊盯著城市中央，那座高聳的大廈。\n倫蒂尼姆的天空，飄過了一片烏雲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
